==German==

===Etymology===
{{dercat|de|gmw-pro|ine-pro}}
From {{der|de|gmh|schicken||to outfit oneself, fit in, arrange appropriately}}, from {{der|de|goh|*skihhen}}, from {{der|de|gmw-pro|*skikkijan}}, from {{der|de|gem-pro|*skikkijaną||to order, send}}. This represents the causative of {{cog|gmh|geschehen|geschehen, geschēn|to happen, rush}}.

Akin to {{cog|enm|skekken||to send forth}}, {{cog|ang|scēon||to happen}}, ''schie-'' in {{cog|nl|schielijk||hasty}}. More at {{m|en|chic}}.

